<title>USA: SierraWest Bancorp sets 5 pct stock div.</title>
<headline>SierraWest Bancorp sets 5 pct stock div.</headline>
<dateline>TRUCKEE, Calif. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>SierraWest Bancorp said Thursday its board had authorized a five percent stock dividend, payable August 29, record August 20.</p>
<p>SierraWest Bancorp is the holding company for SierraWest Bank, headquartered in Truckee, Calif., with branches in Sacramento, the Sierra foothills region of California, Lake Tahoe and northern Nevada.</p>
</text>
